    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nIf you are searching for a charming detached home on the outskirts of New Ross, Rockwall is sure to impress.\n\nSherry FitzGerald Radford are delighted to present this attractive three-bedroom bungalow which comes to the market in turnkey condition and ready for immediate occupancy. Adding further appeal, the property may qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, having been vacant for over two years, along with potential SEAI energy upgrade grants, subject to the relevant terms and conditions.\n\nOccupying a generous elevated south-facing site, Rockwall enjoys panoramic views across New Ross town, the River Barrow, and the iconic Dunbrody Famine Ship. Internally, the home offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout, including a dual-aspect dining room, kitchen, spacious living room with open fireplace, three bedrooms, bathroom, and an attached garage.\n\nSchoolhouse Road is a mature and highly sought-after residential location in New Ross, prized for its peaceful setting, established homes, and exceptional convenience. The property is within walking distance of the town centre, primary and secondary schools, and the South East Greenway. \nWaterford city is just 20 minutes drive and the amazing coastline of South Wexford offering fantastic beaches such as the Blue Flag Duncannon beach is just 30 minutes from the property. \n\nEarly viewing essential!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 1.87m x 1.87m\nPicture window to front, coving, tile floor\n\nEntrance Hall - 4.29m x 1.74m + 4.18m x 1.16m + 0.7m x 1.86m\nLaminate flooring, coving, attic access\n\nLiving Room - 4.6m x 4.9m\nLaminate flooring, fireplace, large window to front, ceiling rose, decorative coving\n\nDining Room - 4.27mx 3.56m\nLaminate flooring, dual aspect windows, decorative coving\n\nKitchen - 4.54m x 3.33m\nTile floor, fitted waist and eye level units, stainless steel sink, coving, garage access point\n\nGarage - 6.3m x 2.88m\nConcrete floor, incorporating wc, access to rear enclosed patio area\n\nBedroom One - 3.3m x 2.88m\nCarpet flooring, coving, alcove space\n\nBathroom - 2.5m x 2.5m\nTiled floor, bath with subway tiled splashback and Briston shower over, wash hand basin with mirror over\n\nHot Press - 0.8m x 0.9m\nShelved\n\nBedroom Two - 3.6m x 3.53m\nTo rear, carpet flooring, stira attic access, coving\n\nBedroom Three - 4m x 3.5m\nTo front, coving, ceiling rose, carpet flooring\n\n"
      },
